        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The perceived lack of consequences for non-response undermines institutional authority.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The legitimacy of Congress depends on its ability to elicit truthful responses from citizens.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Exhaustion experienced by the speaker stems from frustration over civic disengagement.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
