      },
      {
        "text": "My personal reaction was the opposite of fleeing—i.e., to intensify involvement.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "After listening, I consulted the criminal code.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "The discovery of those statutes indicates we are in serious trouble.",
