        "text": "The person being addressed has relevant knowledge or insight into possible legislative solutions.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes it is appropriate to inquire about future legislative intentions.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
