    "turn_idx": 123,
    "turn_text": "Now, obviously, we have a graduated income tax in this country. The more money you make, the more you pay in taxes. Why isn't the same principle applied to these trillion-dollar covert relief bills, meaning why are we giving a single penny to a family that's making over $250,000?",
